<!-- Tiny sanitized WXR 1.2 sample — mirrors the shape produced by
     WordPress's built-in Tools → Export feature. Intentionally
     covers the edge cases the importer MUST handle:

       - Two published posts (wp:1001, wp:1002) with content,
         excerpt, Gutenberg markers, and author attribution.
       - One published page (wp:2001).
       - One draft post that MUST be skipped.
       - One attachment (wp:3001) surfaced via <wp:attachment_url>.
       - One revision item that MUST be skipped (post_type=revision).
       - A nav_menu_item that MUST be skipped.
       - Channel-level <wp:category>, <wp:tag>, <wp:author> blocks
         with slugs + display names.
       - Featured image meta (_thumbnail_id) on wp:1001.
       - An item whose categories carry `nicename` on the tag only
         (wp:1002), exercising the channel-index slug fallback.
-->
